  "{0}Rome remains independent, and the Pope excommunicates the ruler of {1}.": "{0}Roma sigue siendo independiente y el Papa excomulga al gobernante de {1}.",
  "{0}Rome remains independent, and the Pope issues a bull in favour of {1}.": "{0}Roma sigue siendo independiente y el Papa emite una bula a favor de {1}.",
