  "By {0}'s warrant: capture {1} from {2}. Silence its batteries, land your company, and raise": "Mediante orden judicial de {0}: capturar a {1} de {2}. Silencia sus baterías, aterriza tu empresa y eleva",
  "By {0}'s warrant: capture {1} from {2}. Silence its batteries, land your company, and raise {3} colors. Keep the spoils; return for": "Mediante orden judicial de {0}: capturar a {1} de {2}. Silencia sus baterías, aterriza tu empresa y eleva los colores de {3}. Quédate con el botín; regresar para",
  "By {0}'s warrant: capture {1} from {2}. Silence its batteries, land your company, and raise {3} colors. Keep the spoils; return for {4} doubloons.": "Mediante orden judicial de {0}: capturar a {1} de {2}. Silencia sus baterías, aterriza tu empresa y eleva los colores de {3}. Quédate con el botín; regresa por {4} doblones.",
  "By order of {0} of {1}, your ship is barred from {2}. Turn about. No supplies will be sold to you.": "Por orden de {0} de {1}, su barco tiene prohibido el acceso a {2}. Volverse. No se le venderán suministros.",
  "By order of {0}, {1} denies passage to your armed vessel. Turn away.": "Por orden de {0}, {1} niega el paso a su embarcación armada. Rechazar.",
  "By order of {0}, {1} is at war with your flag. Armed vessels will be fired upon.": "Por orden de {0}, {1} está en guerra con tu bandera. Se disparará contra buques armados.",
  "By royal and imperial grace, Malta is granted to the Order in perpetual fief": "Por gracia real e imperial, Malta se concede a la Orden en feudo perpetuo",
