  "lake-battle:{0}": "batalla en el lago:{0}",
  "Lancaran": "Lancaran",
  "Land belongs to the family stories tied to it. I will cross every sea before I let debt cut those ties.": "La tierra pertenece a las historias familiares ligadas a ella. Cruzaré todos los mares antes de permitir que la deuda corte esos lazos.",
  "Land killing blow": "Dar el golpe final",
